<table class="news-table" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Oct 25, 2003 :: Mmm.. more faction and fighting!</div><P>No pictures for this one, because I just didn't think of it. Besides, how exciting can more pictures of the same giants be! Nice work all, we didn't lose any heroes! Sadly, Morlith didn't die either. =/</P>
<P>Grats Vorne on your <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics16/ring_dain_frostweaver.jpg">ring</A>, Colwn on a new <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/rpics/crown_of_narandi.jpg">swanky hat</A>, Drue on a new <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics16/Choker_of_the_Wretched.jpg">neckpiece</A>, Garacaius on a <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics16/faceguard_bentos_hero.jpg">hero's faceguard</A>&nbsp;and Fezz on a <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics16/narandis_lance.jpg">lance</A> to impress the ladies! Garrich got an <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=6789">eye</A> and Wonderbutt got an <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics16/earringfrozenskull.jpg">earring</A> on the GREED rolls! </P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Oct 22, 2003 :: Grats Jen on your Fiery Avenger!!</div><P>After a quick jump up to Plane of Sky, Jen was awarded with her <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics10/fieryavenger.jpg">Fiery Avenger</A>! Grats!!</P>
<P><IMG alt="hot hot hot!" hspace=0 src="http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/jen.jpg" align=baseline border=0> </P>
<P>Going to try to find levels I've missed! I know I'll miss&nbsp;a few, apologies in advance! And.. um.. I blame someone else! Yup, that's it. Not me just being a bum at all.. nooo, never! </P>
<P>Grats Ckaii on 64 (think that's newish)!<BR>Grats Zavitar and&nbsp;Jenrenee&nbsp;on 63 (also thinking that's newish)!<BR>Grats Tylokki on 62!<BR>Grats Cimerene on 61!<BR>Grats Softeyes on 60 and Warlord!<BR>Grats Bashius on 59!<BR>Grats Juhel on 58!<BR>Grats Zentox on 55 and Revenant!<BR>Grats Kreegar on 55 and Animist!<BR>Grats Garrich on 53 (think that's new)!<BR>Grats Cynthiana on 51 (think that's new)!<BR>Grats Morlith on 48!<BR>Grats Moordread on 47!</P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka<br> :: Last edited by Meeka on Oct 23, 2003</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Oct 21, 2003 :: 10th Ring War!</div><P>My scheduled plans fell through since the critters I wanted to kill weren't up. After tracking and finding more suitable things to kill not up, and things that were up weren't really needed, Mahrsan suggested we check on the trigger for the war for his ring. Yes, it's been a small obsession with him for some time. Well, the little guy was up, so we headed to GD and Mahrsan led us against the giants. True, there was no speech given with him pacing back and forth first, which I think will be required by anyone leading this in the future. Regardless of being jipped out of our victory speech, we slaughtered the giants and saved all but one of the heroes. </P>
<P>Everyone did a great job, working together to stop giants who were determined to get to Thurgadin. Very few made it to the bard squad of Myschief, Aridius, Lushissx and Greylok&nbsp;(with Mahrsan and Garacaius), just that one wave which was sent back and killed. Thanks to our chanter duo, Zavitar and Tryder,&nbsp;for buffing while also keeping the giants dead or away! Our rangers watched track and kept us informed; thanks Beryllin, Antroe and Lairiel! Thanks Aridius for being the sacrificial lamb and kiting Narandi around while we buffed up and made sure the healers and nukers were FM. Thanks Lush for following around Aridius in case Narandi got his way with him (he didn't)! Basically, too many people to thank! Everyone did their job and stepped up to stop runners, keep each other alive, and have fun doing it. Oh, and Morlith died! Really, it's no longer a raid until we hear the cry of "Morlith down!"</P>
<P>Grats Mahrsan on <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics16/ring_dain_frostweaver.jpg">Ring of Dain Frostreaver IV</A>, Ckaii on <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/rpics/crown_of_narandi.jpg">Crown of Narandi</A>, Sythmillions on <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics16/Choker_of_the_Wretched.jpg">Choker of the Wretched</A>, Cassana on <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics16/faceguard_bentos_hero.jpg">Faceguard of Bentos the Hero</A>, Sonaddor on <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics16/narandis_lance.jpg">Narandi's Lance</A> and Grace on the GREED roll for <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics16/earringfrozenskull.jpg">Earring of the Frozen Skull</A>. </P>
<P><IMG alt="" hspace=0 src="http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/narandi1.jpg" align=baseline border=0></P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka<br> :: Last edited by Meeka on Oct 22, 2003</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Oct 18, 2003 :: Two more dragons and Vindi!</div><P>Gathered our forces to do some more dragon hunting today, and Raihn found us Lendiniara the Keeper and Sontalek. First we strolled in and took down Lend, to avoid more folks falling KOS before we headed into ToV. Grats Colwn on <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics15/lendiniarastalisman.jpg">Lendiniara's Talisman</A>, Duktak on <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics16/Truesight_Helmet.gif">Truesight Helmet</A> and SG on <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics16/glovesstability.jpg">Gloves of Stability</A>! Ceyria looted several pieces of Kael quest armor as well, nothing earth shattering. </P>
<P><IMG alt="Tryder busted!" hspace=0 src="http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/lend.jpg" align=baseline border=0></P>
<P>After Lend, we headed out to not only kill, but utterly decimate Sontalak. Esorpa of the Ring crashed our party and Vorne offtanked that for the short time Sont was alive. Grats Cass on <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics15/sontalaks_talisman.JPG">Sontalak's Talisman</A>! I think Drue took a picture, cause I kinda forgot, as always! </P>
<P>Saragoth led us to Arena in Kael after this, to fix some faction and kill Vindi. Grats Morlith on <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/fpics/chestplate_of_vindication.jpg">Chestplate of Vindication</A> and Druentia on some head! And I even took a picture before Vindi was reduced to a set of feet!</P>
<H2 style="FONT-SIZE: 22px"><IMG alt="Before he's just feet!!" hspace=0 src="http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/vindiback.jpg" align=baseline border=0></H2><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka<br> :: Last edited by Meeka on Nov 19, 2003</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Oct 17, 2003 :: Grats Zavitar and Voragon!</div><P>Two more epics that I have no pictures for (but really, Voragon doesn't want me to take a picture with old models and no effects... who wants to see a blockhead dwarf with a wrench?)! A group of us ran Voragon to get some final peices while Wonderous led Zavitar, Jen, Cerd, Wellish and Sparkley to clear Fear for us. Once they'd cleared a nice chunk, Team Slacker zoned in and helped finish the job. Reide played crazy cowboy and rounded up Amy Temply and Shissar and soon Zavitar got some much needed head! Voragon did his turn in to Irak whatever and got his epic, and Grik got a step closer to his. </P>
<P>Thanks late night crew for coming out and getting a few mobs killed!</P>
<P>Oh yah... and some of us ran over and did the 8th Shawl War for Tempys! Grats to the Greed Roll winners of the loot! </P>
<P>Levels.. I know some more folks made levels. But Wonderbutt wasn't around to keep up with it all! I remember Khyrra making 40! </P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Oct 16, 2003 :: Feet... more feet!</div><P>More killing of Inny to get some more upgrades and kill the ugly blue bastard! Grat to Lushissx on a shiny new <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/fpics/dreadscale_cloak.jpg">Dreadscale Cloak </A>and Beryllin and Lairiel both walked away with <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/fpics/polished_zraxthril_coif.jpg">Polished Zraxthril Coif</A>! Now for the feet shot!</P>
<P><IMG alt="need Mysch if you don't want feet pics!" hspace=0 src="http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/inny4.jpg" align=baseline border=0></P>
<P>&nbsp;</P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka<br> :: Last edited by Meeka on Oct 16, 2003</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Oct 16, 2003 :: Leveling Updates!</div><P>We've had quite a few guildmates level in the past few days!</P>
<P>Congratulation to the following folks!</P>
<UL>
<LI>Thayet on 61st!
<LI>Aridius on 63rd! 
<LI>Morlith 47th! 
<LI>Lumalie on 58th! 
<LI>Ewlala on 53rd! 
<LI>Tearem on 54th! 
<LI>Cimerene on 60th and Crusader! 
<LI>Tryder on 60 and Phantasmist! 
<LI>Zorin on 56th! 
<LI>Zentox on 54th! 
<LI>Mytee on 50th! 
<LI>Shatta on 49th! 
<LI>Sparkley on 59th! 
<LI>Tylokki on 61st! 
<LI>Arwiin on 48!</LI></UL>
<P>&nbsp;Congrulations to everyone! Keep up the awesome work!.</P>
<P>- Wonderous</P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Wonderous<br> :: Last edited by Wonderous on Oct 17, 2003</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Oct 14, 2003 :: And.. now for something completely different...</div><P>More hedge flagging done. Ran it a bit later to get a few more members who missed out before! Grats Cerdiwan on your Black Bastardsword, Vixxyn on a Twisted Longbow and Sparkley on the greed roll for a Twisted Longbow!</P>
<P><IMG alt="" hspace=0 src="http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/con1.jpg" align=baseline border=0></P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka<br> :: Last edited by Meeka on Oct 16, 2003</p></td></tr></table><p /><span class="page-scroll">Pages: <a href='news.asp?page=11'>&laquo;</a>&nbsp;<a href='news.asp?page=1'>1</a>...<a href='news.asp?page=10'>10</a> <a href='news.asp?page=11'>11</a> 12 <a href='news.asp?page=13'>13</a> <a href='news.asp?page=14'>14</a> <a href='news.asp?page=15'>15</a>&nbsp;<a href='news.asp?page=13'>&raquo;</a></span></td>
